{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.jp_categorical_jet","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.jp_categorical_jet","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.jp_categorical_jet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.jp_categorical_jet","kind":"theorem","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/jp_categorical_jet.lean#L24-L37","doc":"**Lemma statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe categorical jet object\n$J^1(A) := A \\otimes \\Omega^1(A)$, where\n$\\Omega^1(A) = \\ker(m\\colon A\\otimes A \\to A)$ is the bimodule of\nKähler differentials, is an object of the ambient rigid monoidal\ncategory, and inherits a Frobenius--Hopf structure\n$(\\Delta', \\varepsilon', S')$ from $A$.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:jet-prolongation-categorical-jet","label":"lem:jet-prolongation-categorical-jet","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation-categorical-jet.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.antipode_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.antipode_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/jp_categorical_jet.lean#L22-L22","doc":"Antipode `S'` is involutive: `S'^2 = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.S'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.S'","kind":"def","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/jp_categorical_jet.lean#L20-L20","doc":"Antipode operator `S'` on `J^1(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.J1A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.J1A","kind":"def","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/jp_categorical_jet.lean#L18-L18","doc":"The jet prolongation object `J^1(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/jp_categorical_jet.lean#L16-L16","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JpCategoricalJetContext","kind":"class","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/jp_categorical_jet.lean#L15-L22","doc":"Abstract context for `prop:jet-prolongation-categorical-jet`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}